          "author": "Katherine Paterson",
          "note": "US and CA",
          "description": "Jess Aarons has been practicing all summer so he can be the fastest runner in the fifth grade. And he almost is, until the new girl in school, Leslie Burke, outpaces him. The two become fast friends and spend most days in the woods behind Leslie’s house, where they invent an enchanted land called Terabithia.  \n\nA note from Yoto: Bridge to Terabithia is an emotional coming-of-age title for children aged 9+ that touches on themes of death and grief.",
